 * Every market SEOcc can measure keywords in (0.44.3): the countries Google
 * Ads targets and the languages Google Search is offered in, with what each
 * DataForSEO service accepts.
 *
 * The constants are generated from the official lists; do not edit them by
 * hand (the methods below are hand-written):
 * - countries: Google Ads geo targets (geotargets-2026-10-06.csv), status
 *   Active, of type Country or top-level Region (territories such as Taiwan,
 *   Hong Kong, Puerto Rico and Kosovo). Russia and Belarus are left out
 *   because DataForSEO no longer serves them. A country's ID is its Google
 *   Ads criterion ID (2000 + ISO 3166 numeric code, 2900 for Kosovo).
 * - languages: DataForSEO Google SERP languages (2026-04-06). "iw" is left
 *   out as the old code of Hebrew ("he").
 * - ADS_LANGUAGES: the Google Ads languages (languagecodes.csv) whose code
 *   is the same in the SERP list. Keyword volumes for any other language are
 *   asked for the country alone, as Google Ads has no such language filter.
 * - LABS: the language(s) DataForSEO Labs has data for, per country
 *   (locations_and_languages_dataforseo_labs_2026_08_06.csv). Labs writes
 *   Norwegian as "nb"; it is stored here as the SERP code "no".
 */
